# Project Planning - Master's Capstone

The materials in this folder document the development of my master’s capstone project at McDaniel College. The project required me to transform a complex, open-ended assignment into a structured research and production process with defined requirements, deliverables, research tasks, milestones, and deadlines. These materials demonstrate skills in project planning, research and source evaluation, information organization, content development, documentation, and managing a long-term project from initial concept through final deliverable.
